WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:02.220
Instructor: All right, so next up another exercise,

00:02.220 --> 00:04.410
another opportunity to practice things.

00:04.410 --> 00:07.590
And this section covered quite a few different commands.

00:07.590 --> 00:10.320
They all are almost all started with an R, right?

00:10.320 --> 00:13.470
Reset, restore, revert.

00:13.470 --> 00:14.850
Maybe it was just those three,

00:14.850 --> 00:16.260
but it just felt like a lot of Rs

00:16.260 --> 00:17.910
and they all sound similar.

00:17.910 --> 00:20.280
You'll get a chance to practice some of them here.

00:20.280 --> 00:22.770
This exercise is going to cover

00:22.770 --> 00:24.540
most of what we talked about.

00:24.540 --> 00:26.610
And I did say I wouldn't expect you to just

00:26.610 --> 00:27.900
immediately remember them all.

00:27.900 --> 00:31.290
So please feel free to reference notes, Google things.

00:31.290 --> 00:32.520
