07:54.240 --> 07:59.240
So "git add lyrics," "git commit," "finish 404 lyrics."

08:03.510 --> 08:06.480
And then we realize, "Oh, that was actually a mistake."

08:06.480 --> 08:08.430
Shouldn't have done that on the master branch.

08:08.430 --> 08:10.740
I don't even know if I want those lyrics anymore.

08:10.740 --> 08:14.070
So I'm going to move them to a branch called "404,"

08:14.070 --> 08:16.680
but I already made the commits on the master branch.

08:16.680 --> 08:19.560
So I'm going to undo them on master.

08:19.560 --> 08:22.260
So I need to use the "reset" command,

08:22.260 --> 08:24.910
